\begin_layout Section
System description
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The network contains ten buses and four generators. Generators at buses 1 and 2 form Area
\begin_inset space ~

\end_inset

1, while generators at buses 11 and 12 form Area
\begin_inset space ~

\end_inset

2. Three parallel circuits connect buses 3 and 13. The total connected active load is 2734
\begin_inset space ~

\end_inset

MW on a 100-MVA base. Dynamic loads are represented as constant impedances, as specified by Padiyar.
\end_layout

