Independently, the common in-house classical PF/TS infrastructure has been freshly cross-validated against PSAT (v2.1.11) on two network cases. These establish that the shared Newton–Raphson power flow, the classical second-order machine model, the implicit-trapezoidal TS integrator and the network/machine conversion are correct 
\emph on
before
\emph default
