\begin_layout Section
Conclusions
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The Padiyar two-area case provides a traceable replacement reference for the project. It reproduces Table
\begin_inset space ~

\end_inset

9.2 with the in-house power flow, implements the source's actual five-state AVR model, exposes a manual-excitation comparison, and runs SSSA and residual-checked TS from one DAE. No subtransient parameter or PSS setting is fabricated. The next extension may add a documented PSS design and then use this frozen SG baseline for SG-to-VSG replacement studies.
